    rdfs:label "Dual-witness paragraph added to the discussion: server-side signed provenance would close the agent-relay honesty gap and subsume the cost/energy/role provider asks, but is tamper-evident-under-non-collusion rather than tamper-proof (trust shifts to key custody; coverage stops at the API seam; judgements and human rungs remain assertions). Endpoint: provider-signed inference logs + repository commit binding as mutually referencing witnesses. Practices paragraph compressed to pay for it under the 12-page cap; self-citation ratio updated to 4 of 38."@en ;
