<https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/activity/s85-repeat-safe-button> a aiprov:Repair ;
    rdfs:label "Operator reported the confirm-via-issue button working only once. Cause attributed to viewer shells honoring only the first external navigation from a sandboxed frame; the page-side handler also mutated the label without restoring it. Fix: every click immediately copies the issue link to the clipboard alongside the navigation attempt and the label self-resets after three seconds, making repeated use reliable regardless of shell behaviour. Verified with a scripted double-click test (both clicks copy, label resets)."@en ;
    prov:endedAtTime "2026-07-28T07:51:51.727249+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:used <https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/source/build_paper_preview-py> ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith agent:claude-code .

