<https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/activity/s71-skill-v019> a aiprov:AuthoringPass ;
    rdfs:label "Skill v0.19: session learnings folded into SKILL.md and CHANGELOG on operator request. (1) Review worksheet relevance ordering: computed cite counts, disclosed methodology, most load-bearing sources first. (2) Demonstrations-run-on-copies rule: tooling behaviour is shown from a scratch copy of the graph; staged entries in the live record are fabrication. (3) Blocked-canonical-source practice: record the failed canonical fetch and the actual access path; refusing source-vendored is the honest outcome when no redistributable text is obtainable. (4) Self-citations-first guidance: the operator's judgement is uniquely authoritative on works they authored. Skill repackaged."@en ;
