<https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/activity/s84-forge-neutral-buttons> a aiprov:Repair ;
    rdfs:label "Operator feedback: rename the confirm button to git issue for GitLab compatibility, and the button did not work in their viewer. Buttons renamed Confirm/Refuse via git issue; the URL builder now emits the GitLab new-issue pattern (/-/issues/new?issue[title]=...) for GitLab remotes and GitHub otherwise; a clipboard fallback stages the issue link when a sandboxed viewer swallows the navigation. Diagnosis: hrefs and script were valid (no page errors; local click navigates), so the failure is the artifact frame's handling of dynamically-created target=_blank anchors - target removed, sanctioned link navigation kept, fallback added. GitLab CI equivalent of the promote workflow remains future work; the issue-body format and parser are forge-agnostic."@en ;
    prov:endedAtTime "2026-07-28T07:46:22.992894+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:used <https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/source/build_paper_preview-py> ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith agent:claude-code .

