<https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/activity/s56-review-response-v015> a aiprov:AuthoringPass ;
    rdfs:label "Review-response round, operator-directed. Skill v0.15: build_metrics.py as single source of numbers (all paper quantities computed from primary records into doc/metrics.json + paper/metrics.tex macros; methodology block embedded; counterfactuals never computed) - fixes the fragile-numbers weakness structurally; promote --refuse makes disagreement first-class (AuditPass with aiprov:refusedRung, no state change, note required; sandbox-tested). Paper: meta-experiment scoped as demonstration-not-study (one operator, one domain, one session); future work gains the two owed audits from the self-review (independent re-verification of ai-confirmed judgements to measure self-confirmation bias; second operator in second domain for the portability claims); refusal sentence added to Invariant II; nostalgia and copyright paragraphs compressed to hold the 12-page cap."@en ;
    prov:endedAtTime "2026-07-26T06:01:35.822855+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith agent:claude-code ;
