<https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/activity/s80-click-to-confirm> a aiprov:AuthoringPass ;
    rdfs:label "Skill v0.20, two operator requests. (1) Click-to-confirm so the author never touches the repository: worksheet buttons open prefilled GitHub issues; the new aiprov-promote workflow verifies the issue author against doc/operators.json, executes the promotion with the mapped human agent id, regenerates the worksheet, commits, and replies on the issue; unregistered authors and empty notes are refused with a reply. Parsing, authorization, execution, and commit verified in a sandbox dry-run. The artifact-runtime mcp path was assessed and deliberately not shipped: no claude.ai connector is attached to this session, so connector tool shapes cannot be observed, and guessed shapes are not published. (2) Cost footnote: the telemetry table's cost row cites the provider's published price list, registered and content-checked as source anthropic-pricing (page depth, figures quoted), with the basis rendered from the metrics single source as MPriceBasis."@en ;
    prov:endedAtTime "2026-07-28T06:15:10.391356+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:used <https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/source/aiprov-promote-yml>,
        <https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/source/operators-json> ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith agent:claude-code .

aiprov:Claim a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "An assertion in any artefact that warrants attribution and verification."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .

verif:ai-confirmed a aiprov:VerificationState ;
    rdfs:label "AI-confirmed"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An AI agent checked that the source CONTENT supports the associated claim (abstract/full-text cross-check). This is the highest rung an AI may grant; it is a machine judgement, not a human one."@en ;
    aiprov:ladderPosition 3 .

verif:source-vendored a aiprov:VerificationState ;
    rdfs:label "source vendored"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A copy of the source is preserved inside the repository, immune to link rot; the vendored bytes are what any later audit reads."@en ;
    aiprov:ladderPosition 4 .

agent:florian-krebs a aiprov:HumanAgent ;
    foaf:name "Florian Krebs" ;
